(6126955, 901643, 61084, '<td valign="top">I believe this will be DQ''ed due to selective desaturation. The bubbles have color and the rest of the shot doesn''t. Not allowed in minimal.</td>', 'I believe this will be DQ''ed due to selective desaturation. The bubbles have color and the rest of the shot doesn''t. Not allowed in minimal.', '2010-08-11 03:26:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6126961, 902703, 117474, '<td valign="top">Heh. I was concerned with over not being the first word in my entry too! But I read the challenge details and I don''t think it matters. <br/>I like how this shot captures the action of cutting the grass so well. <br/>Minimal editing sucks too, huh? :)</td>', 'Heh. I was concerned with over not being the first word in my entry too! But I read the challenge details and I don''t think it matters. I like how this shot captures the action of cutting the grass so well. Minimal editing sucks too, huh? :)', '2010-08-11 03:38:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6126981, 902209, 117474, '<td valign="top">Super capture, and excellent title. Minimal editing sucks, but I think you''ll do well in this comp.</td>', 'Super capture, and excellent title. Minimal editing sucks, but I think you''ll do well in this comp.', '2010-08-11 04:02:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6127010, 902648, 117474, '<td valign="top">You may not...<br/>add a border to your entry. <br/> <br/>:( This is a great portrait. Minimal rules suck. <br/>I hope it doesn''t get DQ''d. And will vote according to that. 8</td>', 'You may not...add a border to your entry.  :( This is a great portrait. Minimal rules suck. I hope it doesn''t get DQ''d. And will vote according to that. 8', '2010-08-11 04:30:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6127013, 901740, 61084, '<td valign="top">Sorry your title makes no sense, but that''s a moot point because your photo will be dq''ed with the added text on it. This is a minimal editing challenge as well, and looking at your photo which is very nice, but I don''t think it''s straight out of the camera with zero processing besides the text.<br/> <br/>Read the rules.</td>', 'Sorry your title makes no sense, but that''s a moot point because your photo will be dq''ed with the added text on it. This is a minimal editing challenge as well, and looking at your photo which is very nice, but I don''t think it''s straight out of the camera with zero processing besides the text. Read the rules.', '2010-08-11 04:34:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6127014, 902010, 61084, '<td valign="top">Where is the word or phrase "over" or "under" in your title. Cool shot, but unfortunately I don''t see how it meets the challenge. Voting later this week.</td>', 'Where is the word or phrase "over" or "under" in your title. Cool shot, but unfortunately I don''t see how it meets the challenge. Voting later this week.', '2010-08-11 04:35:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6127124, 902468, 23484, '<td valign="top">Nice job on the lighting. Good B&amp;W.</td>', 'Nice job on the lighting. Good B&W.', '2010-08-11 08:21:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6127127, 902112, 23484, '<td valign="top">I like the selective lighting. Nicely composed.</td>', 'I like the selective lighting. Nicely composed.', '2010-08-11 08:22:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6127128, 902218, 23484, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture. Good focus.</td>', 'Very nice capture. Good focus.', '2010-08-11 08:23:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6127129, 902717, 23484, '<td valign="top">I like the separate layers. Nice job.</td>', 'I like the separate layers. Nice job.', '2010-08-11 08:24:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6127159, 902218, 119012, '<td valign="top">what an amazing grab!</td>', 'what an amazing grab!', '2010-08-11 08:47:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6127207, 902801, 116241, '<td valign="top">I would have liked this composition off center.  Otherwise, nice shot.</td>', 'I would have liked this composition off center.  Otherwise, nice shot.', '2010-08-11 09:50:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6127296, 902732, 117474, '<td valign="top">Hehe. Love your title. <br/>Nice capture. It''s a little too dark for my liking, though. <br/>Minimal editing sucks, huh?<br/> <br/>Edit: I didn''t mention anything useful. <br/>I like how the shot looks like it''s made out of four layers (or bricks I suppose) -- the industrial ground, the sun layer and two cloud layers above. I like these stacking kinds of shots.</td>', 'Hehe. Love your title. Nice capture. It''s a little too dark for my liking, though. Minimal editing sucks, huh? Edit: I didn''t mention anything useful. I like how the shot looks like it''s made out of four layers (or bricks I suppose) -- the industrial ground, the sun layer and two cloud layers above. I like these stacking kinds of shots.', '2010-08-11 10:48:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6127338, 901643, 113278, '<td valign="top">Not sure if this meets the minimal editing rules but if you managed to do this in camera and under the rules you get a 10 from me.</td>', 'Not sure if this meets the minimal editing rules but if you managed to do this in camera and under the rules you get a 10 from me.', '2010-08-11 11:35:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6127365, 901643, 117559, '<td valign="top">How did you get the bubble to stay in colour and the rest in black and white?</td>', 'How did you get the bubble to stay in colour and the rest in black and white?', '2010-08-11 12:12:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6127393, 902554, 114225, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective you used. Just a little but of extra color from the yellow portions.<br/>The image feels a little bit soft, almost like it was zoomed in a bit too much.</td>', 'Interesting perspective you used. Just a little but of extra color from the yellow portions.The image feels a little bit soft, almost like it was zoomed in a bit too much.', '2010-08-11 12:39:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6127394, 902588, 114225, '<td valign="top">Good entry for this challenge. The light is confusing me a bit, with the distinct light to dark transition.</td>', 'Good entry for this challenge. The light is confusing me a bit, with the distinct light to dark transition.', '2010-08-11 12:41:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6127395, 902909, 114225, '<td valign="top">Cool shot. The water droplets look like perils. My only real issue with this is what looks like a very high amount of sharpening.</td>', 'Cool shot. The water droplets look like perils. My only real issue with this is what looks like a very high amount of sharpening.', '2010-08-11 12:42:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6127396, 902801, 114225, '<td valign="top">Hmmm, I don''t know that you can over-isolate a macro/flower shot.<br/>I think if you could have reduced the amount of graininess, this could have been a very pleasing shot.</td>', 'Hmmm, I don''t know that you can over-isolate a macro/flower shot.I think if you could have reduced the amount of graininess, this could have been a very pleasing shot.', '2010-08-11 12:43:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6127397, 902074, 114225, '<td valign="top">Good balance to this photo, except the big logo. If that were not visible (I know this is impossible), that would have made this really nice.</td>', 'Good balance to this photo, except the big logo. If that were not visible (I know this is impossible), that would have made this really nice.', '2010-08-11 12:44:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6127402, 902898, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great perspective. Nice clean lines. I only wish it weren''t under-exposed, as I would have liked to see more of the details.</td>', 'Great perspective. Nice clean lines. I only wish it weren''t under-exposed, as I would have liked to see more of the details.', '2010-08-11 12:45:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6127404, 902149, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective and setup. Good even lighting.</td>', 'Nice perspective and setup. Good even lighting.', '2010-08-11 12:46:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6127407, 902574, 114225, '<td valign="top">Funny, to my eye, this looks like just the right amount of saturation. Good detail and lighting in this shot.</td>', 'Funny, to my eye, this looks like just the right amount of saturation. Good detail and lighting in this shot.', '2010-08-11 12:47:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6127409, 902646, 114225, '<td valign="top">That''s cool how the three different droplets have different views of the scene. Very good colors and lighting.</td>', 'That''s cool how the three different droplets have different views of the scene. Very good colors and lighting.', '2010-08-11 12:47:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6127411, 902978, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice creativity in the title. I think this could have had even more impact with a tighter crop so we didn''t see as much of the background.</td>', 'Nice creativity in the title. I think this could have had even more impact with a tighter crop so we didn''t see as much of the background.', '2010-08-11 12:48:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6127415, 902648, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very nice clarity and good soft lighting. The black and white is good here.<br/>Not sure that I see "overjoyed" in her face, more like "can you stop taking photos now?"</td>', 'Very nice clarity and good soft lighting. The black and white is good here.Not sure that I see "overjoyed" in her face, more like "can you stop taking photos now?"', '2010-08-11 12:50:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6127417, 902218, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great clarity and details. Good job stopping the action at such a crucial point in the jump.</td>', 'Great clarity and details. Good job stopping the action at such a crucial point in the jump.', '2010-08-11 12:51:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6127418, 902532, 114225, '<td valign="top">Good idea for the challenge. I would suggest using a bit more light so we could see more of the details.</td>', 'Good idea for the challenge. I would suggest using a bit more light so we could see more of the details.', '2010-08-11 12:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6127423, 902459, 114225, '<td valign="top">I was guessing someone would do an overcast landscape. This is a cool scene, I only wish it were a little brighter.</td>', 'I was guessing someone would do an overcast landscape. This is a cool scene, I only wish it were a little brighter.', '2010-08-11 12:54:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6127425, 902375, 114225, '<td valign="top">Good creativity and nice setup. I like the soft light that looks natural.</td>', 'Good creativity and nice setup. I like the soft light that looks natural.', '2010-08-11 12:55:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6127428, 902176, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice use of sepia tone to bring an ageless feeling to this photo. It really helps in the sky (mutes is a bit so we can concentrate more on the subject).</td>', 'Nice use of sepia tone to bring an ageless feeling to this photo. It really helps in the sky (mutes is a bit so we can concentrate more on the subject).', '2010-08-11 12:56:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6127431, 902709, 114225, '<td valign="top">A very interesting and perplexing shot. The wine in the standing glass almost feels as if it''s boiling.</td>', 'A very interesting and perplexing shot. The wine in the standing glass almost feels as if it''s boiling.', '2010-08-11 12:58:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6127434, 902242, 114225, '<td valign="top">Interesting how this is almost the exact same scene as an Under photo. I like the deeper color of the jets better in the one, but the tighter crop of the other one.</td>', 'Interesting how this is almost the exact same scene as an Under photo. I like the deeper color of the jets better in the one, but the tighter crop of the other one.', '2010-08-11 13:06:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6127436, 902868, 114225, '<td valign="top">Cool scene, and good use of s-curves. Too bad that other photographer is in there, messing with your scene.</td>', 'Cool scene, and good use of s-curves. Too bad that other photographer is in there, messing with your scene.', '2010-08-11 13:07:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6127438, 902578, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great quartering-away perspective, especially for the title. Nice clarity and crop.</td>', 'Great quartering-away perspective, especially for the title. Nice clarity and crop.', '2010-08-11 13:07:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6127440, 902482, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very nice lighting and coloring to this shot. Not super interesting, but the technicals are well done.</td>', 'Very nice lighting and coloring to this shot. Not super interesting, but the technicals are well done.', '2010-08-11 13:09:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6127444, 902622, 61961, '<td valign="top">Good shot.  I really thought this was going to be titled "Overtanned."</td>', 'Good shot.  I really thought this was going to be titled "Overtanned."', '2010-08-11 13:17:59.000000', NULL, 1),
