(6127569, 902356, 96751, '<td valign="top">Oh, this is really nice.  The motion blur really makes this shot, as does the interesting pov.  It would be nice to see a version with a bit more contrast, not for this challenge of course.  Well seen and captured.</td>', 'Oh, this is really nice.  The motion blur really makes this shot, as does the interesting pov.  It would be nice to see a version with a bit more contrast, not for this challenge of course.  Well seen and captured.', '2010-08-11 15:00:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6127571, 902709, 96751, '<td valign="top">Amazing what can be done with minimal editing.</td>', 'Amazing what can be done with minimal editing.', '2010-08-11 15:00:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6127574, 902482, 96751, '<td valign="top">Nice!</td>', 'Nice!', '2010-08-11 15:03:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6127622, 902468, 86447, '<td valign="top">Oh my word!  Brilliant!   Even the title!  (not voting)</td>', 'Oh my word!  Brilliant!   Even the title!  (not voting)', '2010-08-11 15:42:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6127711, 902954, 114225, '<td valign="top">I had thoughts to do something like this. I like how you choose a setting with the bench in the background, that adds interest to the photo.</td>', 'I had thoughts to do something like this. I like how you choose a setting with the bench in the background, that adds interest to the photo.', '2010-08-11 18:08:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6127712, 902872, 114225, '<td valign="top">Interesting thought for this challenge, but unfortunately, an un-interesting photo. I think the biggest issue to work on is the lighting. The heavy reflections and shadows make it unappealing.</td>', 'Interesting thought for this challenge, but unfortunately, an un-interesting photo. I think the biggest issue to work on is the lighting. The heavy reflections and shadows make it unappealing.', '2010-08-11 18:09:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6127713, 902118, 114225, '<td valign="top">Good lighting. I like the color cast used, and you have very good clarity.</td>', 'Good lighting. I like the color cast used, and you have very good clarity.', '2010-08-11 18:10:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6127716, 902703, 114225, '<td valign="top">I will give you a pass on the title since you used parentheses :)<br/>I really like the lighting, colors, and perspective you have in this photo. Also, great job catching the grass in the air.</td>', 'I will give you a pass on the title since you used parentheses :)I really like the lighting, colors, and perspective you have in this photo. Also, great job catching the grass in the air.', '2010-08-11 18:13:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6127724, 902199, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like it. Good title and very nice silhouette.</td>', 'I like it. Good title and very nice silhouette.', '2010-08-11 18:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6127813, 902966, 114225, '<td valign="top">This is the only entry (at least that I have seen so far) that really does justice to the phrase "over there."</td>', 'This is the only entry (at least that I have seen so far) that really does justice to the phrase "over there."', '2010-08-11 22:02:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6127816, 902884, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very well done. Good perspective, lighting, and details. Interesting that you went with shoes instead of the standard socks or barefoot on a scale.</td>', 'Very well done. Good perspective, lighting, and details. Interesting that you went with shoes instead of the standard socks or barefoot on a scale.', '2010-08-11 22:04:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6127828, 902701, 114225, '<td valign="top">Follow the gourd! I had to get in a Monty Python reference with a title like that.<br/>Oh, and you did a nice job with the photo too. Good exposure and use of depth of field.</td>', 'Follow the gourd! I had to get in a Monty Python reference with a title like that.Oh, and you did a nice job with the photo too. Good exposure and use of depth of field.', '2010-08-11 22:22:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6127960, 902709, 115307, '<td valign="top">Wow, it is amazing what you can accomplish with Minimal Editing. This truly shows your skill as a photographer. I certainly couldn''t produce something like this on camera. The image is perfectly in focus, with vibrant colors, and a title that relates well. It is very well done!<br/>For some reason though, the composition seems awkward to me, though I can''t place my finger on why. I think it might be because the empty glass rests on a "thirds" line while the full cup doesn''t, which unbalances the composition away from the more interesting subject matter (the full cup). That''s just speculation though. It just feels "off" to me.<br/>That is a tiny nitpick of course. The pros of the picture far out weigh. I just thought I''d bring it up, since it is my experience the good photographs usually just get the positive feedback and no voices for improvement :-)<br/>You are receiving an 8 from me.</td>', 'Wow, it is amazing what you can accomplish with Minimal Editing. This truly shows your skill as a photographer. I certainly couldn''t produce something like this on camera. The image is perfectly in focus, with vibrant colors, and a title that relates well. It is very well done!For some reason though, the composition seems awkward to me, though I can''t place my finger on why. I think it might be because the empty glass rests on a "thirds" line while the full cup doesn''t, which unbalances the composition away from the more interesting subject matter (the full cup). That''s just speculation though. It just feels "off" to me.That is a tiny nitpick of course. The pros of the picture far out weigh. I just thought I''d bring it up, since it is my experience the good photographs usually just get the positive feedback and no voices for improvement :-)You are receiving an 8 from me.', '2010-08-12 02:47:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6127962, 902698, 115307, '<td valign="top">I think this picture would have done better in color. It is a nice landscape with good composition, but as a black and white picture it is MUCH too gray. Obviously for a minimal editing challenge you couldn''t change that in editing afterwards, which is why I think if it had remained in color this would have done better. 5</td>', 'I think this picture would have done better in color. It is a nice landscape with good composition, but as a black and white picture it is MUCH too gray. Obviously for a minimal editing challenge you couldn''t change that in editing afterwards, which is why I think if it had remained in color this would have done better. 5', '2010-08-12 02:59:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6127963, 902868, 115307, '<td valign="top">Great Photojournalism. I love pictures that tell a story like this one does. My eye keeps going back to the little girl in the top left corner 7</td>', 'Great Photojournalism. I love pictures that tell a story like this one does. My eye keeps going back to the little girl in the top left corner 7', '2010-08-12 03:01:42.000000', NULL, 1),
