(6128896, 902192, 54446, '<td valign="top">Technically excellent.  Superb control of exposure, especially considering the daylight.  Well composed.  9</td>', 'Technically excellent.  Superb control of exposure, especially considering the daylight.  Well composed.  9', '2010-08-13 07:30:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6128897, 902978, 54446, '<td valign="top">One of my favs in this challenge.  Pretty good photojournalism image.  Considering you probably didn''t have too much time to think and plan, this is a fine capture of the incident.  Good focus, good timing, good inclusion of the venue and the participants.  9</td>', 'One of my favs in this challenge.  Pretty good photojournalism image.  Considering you probably didn''t have too much time to think and plan, this is a fine capture of the incident.  Good focus, good timing, good inclusion of the venue and the participants.  9', '2010-08-13 07:33:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6128898, 902968, 54446, '<td valign="top">This might have been the blue ribbon except for the clipping of a helmet, a couple mallets and a less than ideal composition.  Very good exposure, nice color saturation and pretty good freeze of the action.  Would have benefitted from a more narrow DOF.</td>', 'This might have been the blue ribbon except for the clipping of a helmet, a couple mallets and a less than ideal composition.  Very good exposure, nice color saturation and pretty good freeze of the action.  Would have benefitted from a more narrow DOF.', '2010-08-13 07:35:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6128900, 901759, 54446, '<td valign="top">Beautiful scene.  Superb deep DOF.  Needs a slight CW rotation... especially noticed on the horizon and the vertical building lines.  Exposure is very nice.  Colors are grand.</td>', 'Beautiful scene.  Superb deep DOF.  Needs a slight CW rotation... especially noticed on the horizon and the vertical building lines.  Exposure is very nice.  Colors are grand.', '2010-08-13 07:37:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6128901, 901779, 54446, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites in this challenge.  Excellent composition.  Natural indoor lighting.  9</td>', 'One of my favorites in this challenge.  Excellent composition.  Natural indoor lighting.  9', '2010-08-13 07:38:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6128902, 902621, 54446, '<td valign="top">Good concept.  I like the exposure.  Maybe one or two too many items.  Seems slightly cluttered, but I understand what you were trying to display.  Good title.  Lots of thought went into this.</td>', 'Good concept.  I like the exposure.  Maybe one or two too many items.  Seems slightly cluttered, but I understand what you were trying to display.  Good title.  Lots of thought went into this.', '2010-08-13 07:40:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6128905, 902717, 54446, '<td valign="top">Wonderful bands of colors and textures.  The truck and dust are excellent elements of interest.  There is a slight lack of clarity throughout.  I''m guessing handheld shot.  Slight camera shake.  Still good image, though.</td>', 'Wonderful bands of colors and textures.  The truck and dust are excellent elements of interest.  There is a slight lack of clarity throughout.  I''m guessing handheld shot.  Slight camera shake.  Still good image, though.', '2010-08-13 07:44:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6128906, 902734, 54446, '<td valign="top">For minimal editing, this is outstanding exposure.</td>', 'For minimal editing, this is outstanding exposure.', '2010-08-13 07:44:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6128907, 902703, 54446, '<td valign="top">Good freeze of the flying grass.  The narrow DOF is nice, but I''m not sure I like the amount of OOF foreground relative to the size of the subject.   The composition is okay, but not optimal.</td>', 'Good freeze of the flying grass.  The narrow DOF is nice, but I''m not sure I like the amount of OOF foreground relative to the size of the subject.   The composition is okay, but not optimal.', '2010-08-13 07:47:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6128908, 902695, 54446, '<td valign="top">Shot through an airplane window?  It''s a good cityscape, but does have a slightly hazy look.  And, the partly clouds casting partly shadows weakens the image somewhat.  Not bad, though, if this was shot through an airplane window.</td>', 'Shot through an airplane window?  It''s a good cityscape, but does have a slightly hazy look.  And, the partly clouds casting partly shadows weakens the image somewhat.  Not bad, though, if this was shot through an airplane window.', '2010-08-13 07:49:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6128910, 902622, 54446, '<td valign="top">Good exposure of the subject.  The background sunlit areas distract somewhat.  The composition needs to be less symmetrical.</td>', 'Good exposure of the subject.  The background sunlit areas distract somewhat.  The composition needs to be less symmetrical.', '2010-08-13 07:54:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6128912, 902574, 54446, '<td valign="top">Good macro shot with effective narrow DOF.  Good colors.</td>', 'Good macro shot with effective narrow DOF.  Good colors.', '2010-08-13 07:54:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6128913, 902959, 54446, '<td valign="top">I''d like to see more clarity and focused detail somewhere in the scene.  The sky is exposed well.</td>', 'I''d like to see more clarity and focused detail somewhere in the scene.  The sky is exposed well.', '2010-08-13 07:56:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6128914, 902731, 54446, '<td valign="top">Cute horse pose.  A bit underexposed on my monitor.</td>', 'Cute horse pose.  A bit underexposed on my monitor.', '2010-08-13 07:56:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6128915, 902646, 54446, '<td valign="top">Wonderful clarity and color saturation.  The blurred background really makes the water droplets pop.</td>', 'Wonderful clarity and color saturation.  The blurred background really makes the water droplets pop.', '2010-08-13 07:57:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6128916, 901866, 54446, '<td valign="top">Good night cityscape.  Appropriate title.  Foreground in silhouette is okay.  Overall, seems a bit distant.  Probably needs a focal point, rather than just an array of lit buildings.</td>', 'Good night cityscape.  Appropriate title.  Foreground in silhouette is okay.  Overall, seems a bit distant.  Probably needs a focal point, rather than just an array of lit buildings.', '2010-08-13 07:59:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6128919, 902683, 54446, '<td valign="top">Superb corrosion and oxidation.  Vert and horiz lines nicely squared away.  Natural and interesting colors.  10</td>', 'Superb corrosion and oxidation.  Vert and horiz lines nicely squared away.  Natural and interesting colors.  10', '2010-08-13 08:06:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6128921, 902176, 118008, '<td valign="top">could use a bit more contrast</td>', 'could use a bit more contrast', '2010-08-13 08:13:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6129126, 902400, 54446, '<td valign="top">Composed just a bit too tightly.  Good exposure and natural colors.</td>', 'Composed just a bit too tightly.  Good exposure and natural colors.', '2010-08-13 14:02:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6129130, 901992, 54446, '<td valign="top">Effective use of narrow DOF.  Seems to be a warm color cast, but it works.  Maybe the paper was tan/reddish tint.  Pretty good focus and detail where it counts.</td>', 'Effective use of narrow DOF.  Seems to be a warm color cast, but it works.  Maybe the paper was tan/reddish tint.  Pretty good focus and detail where it counts.', '2010-08-13 14:04:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6129132, 902618, 54446, '<td valign="top">Took me a moment to determine what I was looking at.  The Century plant is the subject.  It''s a posterior shot of the wheelbarrow.  And, teh trash on the ground is a serious distraction.  The exposure is fine.</td>', 'Took me a moment to determine what I was looking at.  The Century plant is the subject.  It''s a posterior shot of the wheelbarrow.  And, teh trash on the ground is a serious distraction.  The exposure is fine.', '2010-08-13 14:06:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6129134, 902169, 54446, '<td valign="top">Okay as a landscape.  Too distant to be an architectural study.  The light and colors are flat, although the exposure is good.  Lacks dynamic light.  Needs less lawn and more lens focal length to show building detail.  Love the setting.</td>', 'Okay as a landscape.  Too distant to be an architectural study.  The light and colors are flat, although the exposure is good.  Lacks dynamic light.  Needs less lawn and more lens focal length to show building detail.  Love the setting.', '2010-08-13 14:08:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6129137, 902698, 54446, '<td valign="top">Dream Lake in RMNP.  The b&amp;w works.  Nice detail and DOF.  Begs for postprocessing to bring up the shadows.  This location always has a bright sky and lake/trees in shadows.  For the minimal challenge, you could have used soft grad ND filters on the sky to constrain the dynamic range.</td>', 'Dream Lake in RMNP.  The b&w works.  Nice detail and DOF.  Begs for postprocessing to bring up the shadows.  This location always has a bright sky and lake/trees in shadows.  For the minimal challenge, you could have used soft grad ND filters on the sky to constrain the dynamic range.', '2010-08-13 14:10:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6129138, 902868, 54446, '<td valign="top">Great in areas where flame light illuminates detail.  Love the reflection.  A bit murky in the dark areas.</td>', 'Great in areas where flame light illuminates detail.  Love the reflection.  A bit murky in the dark areas.', '2010-08-13 14:11:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6129139, 902410, 54446, '<td valign="top">Descriptive title.  The composition seems center-middle too much.  I do like the narrow DOF with blurred background.</td>', 'Descriptive title.  The composition seems center-middle too much.  I do like the narrow DOF with blurred background.', '2010-08-13 14:12:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6129140, 902074, 54446, '<td valign="top">Dramatic structures and lights.  Good exposure and detail.</td>', 'Dramatic structures and lights.  Good exposure and detail.', '2010-08-13 14:14:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6129142, 902957, 54446, '<td valign="top">Excellent subject.  The day light is a bit harsh, but is only a problem with the reflection off the left window.  Goo deail and focus.  Appropriate deep DOF.</td>', 'Excellent subject.  The day light is a bit harsh, but is only a problem with the reflection off the left window.  Goo deail and focus.  Appropriate deep DOF.', '2010-08-13 14:16:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6129143, 902459, 54446, '<td valign="top">Probably more partly cloudy, than overcast.  Some detail lost in brightest highlights and blackest shadows.  The dynamic range is extreme, which makes this scene very challenging to photograph in a minimal editing challenge.  The scene has potential to be dramatically beautiful.</td>', 'Probably more partly cloudy, than overcast.  Some detail lost in brightest highlights and blackest shadows.  The dynamic range is extreme, which makes this scene very challenging to photograph in a minimal editing challenge.  The scene has potential to be dramatically beautiful.', '2010-08-13 14:16:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6129146, 902118, 54446, '<td valign="top">Good water flow image.  Has interesting bubbles and gurgles.  I''ll assume the blue tone monochrome (if added) is legal in minimal editing.  I like the composition.</td>', 'Good water flow image.  Has interesting bubbles and gurgles.  I''ll assume the blue tone monochrome (if added) is legal in minimal editing.  I like the composition.', '2010-08-13 14:18:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6129148, 902927, 54446, '<td valign="top">The image is interesting in its own way.</td>', 'The image is interesting in its own way.', '2010-08-13 14:19:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6129149, 902973, 54446, '<td valign="top">Blown out highlights in the upper center.  Blue/green color cast to the clouds... which is not impossible in the case of a severe storm bearing hail and wind.  The blue sky on the right is beautiful, so I''m confused about the unnatural colors in the clouds.  Must be a color temp issue.  The land portion is somewhat underexposed in the shaded areas.  Overall, this scene would be difficult to capture (because of the wide dynamic range) for a minimal editing challenge.  You might have found great benefit from using soft grad ND filters on the sky.</td>', 'Blown out highlights in the upper center.  Blue/green color cast to the clouds... which is not impossible in the case of a severe storm bearing hail and wind.  The blue sky on the right is beautiful, so I''m confused about the unnatural colors in the clouds.  Must be a color temp issue.  The land portion is somewhat underexposed in the shaded areas.  Overall, this scene would be difficult to capture (because of the wide dynamic range) for a minimal editing challenge.  You might have found great benefit from using soft grad ND filters on the sky.', '2010-08-13 14:23:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6129151, 902880, 54446, '<td valign="top">A good candid image.  Tilts a bit to the left, but it doesn''t bother me.  Good exposure, detail and colors.</td>', 'A good candid image.  Tilts a bit to the left, but it doesn''t bother me.  Good exposure, detail and colors.', '2010-08-13 14:24:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6129153, 902121, 54446, '<td valign="top">A very good seascape and sunset image.  The exposure is pretty good.  The foreground and middle area focus seems good.  The detail in the clouds seems a bit muddy, as if beyond the DOF plane.  The top and middle light is dynamic.  The foreground light and colors are flat.</td>', 'A very good seascape and sunset image.  The exposure is pretty good.  The foreground and middle area focus seems good.  The detail in the clouds seems a bit muddy, as if beyond the DOF plane.  The top and middle light is dynamic.  The foreground light and colors are flat.', '2010-08-13 14:26:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6129154, 901939, 54446, '<td valign="top">Pretty good marcro image with appropriate narrow DOF.  It''s tack sharp where it counts.  A few pixels of blown out highlights, but seems natural.  Great colors.</td>', 'Pretty good marcro image with appropriate narrow DOF.  It''s tack sharp where it counts.  A few pixels of blown out highlights, but seems natural.  Great colors.', '2010-08-13 14:27:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6129155, 901637, 54446, '<td valign="top">Good water flow drops capture.  The background distracts a bit.  Some softness in the drops here and there.  A good concept, but sort of begs for a crop.</td>', 'Good water flow drops capture.  The background distracts a bit.  Some softness in the drops here and there.  A good concept, but sort of begs for a crop.', '2010-08-13 14:27:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6129159, 902980, 54446, '<td valign="top">Silhouetted branches are good.  Focus and detail seem good, too.  The river and far shore ground the scene, but lack enough interesting elements.   The twigs intrusion in the upper left is distracting and could/should have been composed out of the scene.    Okay sky and clouds.</td>', 'Silhouetted branches are good.  Focus and detail seem good, too.  The river and far shore ground the scene, but lack enough interesting elements.   The twigs intrusion in the upper left is distracting and could/should have been composed out of the scene.    Okay sky and clouds.', '2010-08-13 14:31:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6129160, 902468, 54446, '<td valign="top">Cute child.  Focus is right on.  I especially like the composition.</td>', 'Cute child.  Focus is right on.  I especially like the composition.', '2010-08-13 14:31:52.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(6129161, 902010, 54446, '<td valign="top">This is a really dramatic and dynamic image.  Great pose, well captured.  The weakest part of the presentation is the title, which is a stretch.  9</td>', 'This is a really dramatic and dynamic image.  Great pose, well captured.  The weakest part of the presentation is the title, which is a stretch.  9', '2010-08-13 14:33:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6129164, 902970, 54446, '<td valign="top">The problem with waterfall images captured in the complete shade, in low light conditions, is the absence of dynamic light.  The exposure is good with little or no blown out highlights.  Some of the land/vegetation seems underexposed.  The colors are okay.  The white balance is excellent and could have been off considering the light conditions.</td>', 'The problem with waterfall images captured in the complete shade, in low light conditions, is the absence of dynamic light.  The exposure is good with little or no blown out highlights.  Some of the land/vegetation seems underexposed.  The colors are okay.  The white balance is excellent and could have been off considering the light conditions.', '2010-08-13 14:35:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6129166, 902242, 54446, '<td valign="top">Great subject.  Not quite as much clarity and sharpness as is possible.  The sky is not an asset.  The ground, trees, buildings seem underexposed.  I do like the composition.</td>', 'Great subject.  Not quite as much clarity and sharpness as is possible.  The sky is not an asset.  The ground, trees, buildings seem underexposed.  I do like the composition.', '2010-08-13 14:38:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6129170, 901662, 54446, '<td valign="top">I understand your goal of showing an image with a very narrow DOF.  The 1.2 is sharp and clear.  For this image, it makes me wanting to see clarity and sharpness throughout.  I especially find the glass OOF distracting.</td>', 'I understand your goal of showing an image with a very narrow DOF.  The 1.2 is sharp and clear.  For this image, it makes me wanting to see clarity and sharpness throughout.  I especially find the glass OOF distracting.', '2010-08-13 14:40:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6129172, 902732, 54446, '<td valign="top">In retrospect, you may find this scene to be a poor choice for a minimal editing challenge.   Sort of has a post-apopolyctic feel.  If that''s what you were going for, then you achieved it.</td>', 'In retrospect, you may find this scene to be a poor choice for a minimal editing challenge.   Sort of has a post-apopolyctic feel.  If that''s what you were going for, then you achieved it.', '2010-08-13 14:43:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6129173, 902595, 54446, '<td valign="top">Good title which relates to the fireworks experience most of have had.  Pretty good fireworks capture, even if "blocked" somewhat by the people silhouettes.</td>', 'Good title which relates to the fireworks experience most of have had.  Pretty good fireworks capture, even if "blocked" somewhat by the people silhouettes.', '2010-08-13 14:44:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6129175, 902852, 54446, '<td valign="top">Excessive dynamic range in this scene makes it a difficult choice for a minimal editing challenge.  I love the luminance and reflection on the wet sand.  The ocean seems distant and begs for more detail from the surf and people.  The sky has great elements of interest.  The hills on the right are mostly lost to the shadows.</td>', 'Excessive dynamic range in this scene makes it a difficult choice for a minimal editing challenge.  I love the luminance and reflection on the wet sand.  The ocean seems distant and begs for more detail from the surf and people.  The sky has great elements of interest.  The hills on the right are mostly lost to the shadows.', '2010-08-13 14:48:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6129177, 902709, 54446, '<td valign="top">Technically very good.  Composed well, but seems to be composed too tightly on the top... clipping the top of the splash.</td>', 'Technically very good.  Composed well, but seems to be composed too tightly on the top... clipping the top of the splash.', '2010-08-13 14:49:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6129178, 902007, 54446, '<td valign="top">Good frog image.  Nicely done!</td>', 'Good frog image.  Nicely done!', '2010-08-13 14:50:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6129179, 902162, 54446, '<td valign="top">True.</td>', 'True.', '2010-08-13 14:50:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6129180, 902911, 54446, '<td valign="top">Poignant scene.  Would have been great to see the calf, too.</td>', 'Poignant scene.  Would have been great to see the calf, too.', '2010-08-13 14:51:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6129181, 902872, 54446, '<td valign="top">Shapes and shadows okay.  Lighting seems harsh.</td>', 'Shapes and shadows okay.  Lighting seems harsh.', '2010-08-13 14:51:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6129185, 902554, 54446, '<td valign="top">While the flower exposure seems about right, it doesn''t snap to clarity and focus on my screen.  Might be camera shake, unless you used a tripod.  I find the composition to be awkward.  Too much pad and lake in the OOF portion, with too little blossom in focus.</td>', 'While the flower exposure seems about right, it doesn''t snap to clarity and focus on my screen.  Might be camera shake, unless you used a tripod.  I find the composition to be awkward.  Too much pad and lake in the OOF portion, with too little blossom in focus.', '2010-08-13 14:55:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6129187, 902954, 54446, '<td valign="top">A good effort.  I like the composition.  The title goes well with the image.</td>', 'A good effort.  I like the composition.  The title goes well with the image.', '2010-08-13 14:56:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6129189, 902963, 54446, '<td valign="top">Good stop action.  The liquid surface is abstract, for sure.</td>', 'Good stop action.  The liquid surface is abstract, for sure.', '2010-08-13 14:57:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6129190, 902505, 54446, '<td valign="top">Pretty interesting insect image, in a creepy way.  Good exposure and colors.  Well blurred bg.</td>', 'Pretty interesting insect image, in a creepy way.  Good exposure and colors.  Well blurred bg.', '2010-08-13 14:58:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6129192, 902149, 54446, '<td valign="top">Good title and concept.  Well executed.</td>', 'Good title and concept.  Well executed.', '2010-08-13 14:58:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6129193, 901739, 54446, '<td valign="top">Good sky.  Well exposed with good, deep DOF.  Not sure I like the perspective.</td>', 'Good sky.  Well exposed with good, deep DOF.  Not sure I like the perspective.', '2010-08-13 15:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6129196, 902588, 54446, '<td valign="top">Sure looks like a vignette around the outside of the image, but I''ll assume it''s the lighting.  My larger complaint about the image would be the large area of blown out highlights in the middle</td>', 'Sure looks like a vignette around the outside of the image, but I''ll assume it''s the lighting.  My larger complaint about the image would be the large area of blown out highlights in the middle', '2010-08-13 15:01:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6129198, 902145, 54446, '<td valign="top">Good use of silhouettes.  The title works.  Very good light on the lake.  The sky color and lack of interesting detail distracts.</td>', 'Good use of silhouettes.  The title works.  Very good light on the lake.  The sky color and lack of interesting detail distracts.', '2010-08-13 15:02:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6129199, 902578, 54446, '<td valign="top">Focus is good.  Narrow DOF is effective.  The exposure on the gull is problematic. Underexposed in several areas, while nearly blown out on white-ish feathers in the sunlight.</td>', 'Focus is good.  Narrow DOF is effective.  The exposure on the gull is problematic. Underexposed in several areas, while nearly blown out on white-ish feathers in the sunlight.', '2010-08-13 15:04:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6129200, 902482, 54446, '<td valign="top">I think the water flow and drops are too blurred.  Might have been better to use a faster shutter speed to achieve more sharpness and clarity.</td>', 'I think the water flow and drops are too blurred.  Might have been better to use a faster shutter speed to achieve more sharpness and clarity.', '2010-08-13 15:05:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6129201, 902909, 54446, '<td valign="top">Very good presentation.  The subject and the comp are the image strenghts.  Was it raining?  as I don''t quite understand the minor streaks here and there.  The light sparkles suggest the use of a (legal) star filter, which was a good choice.</td>', 'Very good presentation.  The subject and the comp are the image strenghts.  Was it raining?  as I don''t quite understand the minor streaks here and there.  The light sparkles suggest the use of a (legal) star filter, which was a good choice.', '2010-08-13 15:09:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6129202, 902602, 54446, '<td valign="top">Not sure the subject is in focus.  Looks like it might have been a little soft and sharpened in pp.  That''s okay, but would have had more clarity if the focus had been a bit better in the first place.</td>', 'Not sure the subject is in focus.  Looks like it might have been a little soft and sharpened in pp.  That''s okay, but would have had more clarity if the focus had been a bit better in the first place.', '2010-08-13 15:10:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6129203, 902209, 54446, '<td valign="top">Outstanding focus and detail.  However, the light and colors are flat.  For wildlife images, it''s usually best to show a more dynamic eye-catch glint.</td>', 'Outstanding focus and detail.  However, the light and colors are flat.  For wildlife images, it''s usually best to show a more dynamic eye-catch glint.', '2010-08-13 15:12:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6129204, 902458, 54446, '<td valign="top">The image is better than the title choice.  Light and colors are a bit flat, as they will be on a cloudy day.</td>', 'The image is better than the title choice.  Light and colors are a bit flat, as they will be on a cloudy day.', '2010-08-13 15:14:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6129206, 902801, 54446, '<td valign="top">Good use of narrow DOF.  The light and colors are flat, but I like the symmetrical composition.</td>', 'Good use of narrow DOF.  The light and colors are flat, but I like the symmetrical composition.', '2010-08-13 15:15:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6129207, 902701, 54446, '<td valign="top">The title refers to the man.  The foreground painted gourds are in focus.  Some hot spots in the background foliage.  Might have been better to place the man with some gourds in the DOF plane.</td>', 'The title refers to the man.  The foreground painted gourds are in focus.  Some hot spots in the background foliage.  Might have been better to place the man with some gourds in the DOF plane.', '2010-08-13 15:16:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6129210, 902196, 54446, '<td valign="top">I think the title doesn''t work for the challenge.  The image is mighty interesting.  However it occurred, the watercolor effect is unique.</td>', 'I think the title doesn''t work for the challenge.  The image is mighty interesting.  However it occurred, the watercolor effect is unique.', '2010-08-13 15:19:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6129211, 902883, 54446, '<td valign="top">Good long exposure.  The reflection off the foreground water distracts.  Probably too much black space around the subject.</td>', 'Good long exposure.  The reflection off the foreground water distracts.  Probably too much black space around the subject.', '2010-08-13 15:20:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6129212, 902640, 54446, '<td valign="top">Best title in the challenge.   Interesting cityscape.  Might be a bit cluttered, but it does convey the chaos very well.</td>', 'Best title in the challenge.   Interesting cityscape.  Might be a bit cluttered, but it does convey the chaos very well.', '2010-08-13 15:21:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6129213, 902972, 54446, '<td valign="top">Good exposure.  Good title.  Seems to lack dynamic light and needs an additional element of interest.</td>', 'Good exposure.  Good title.  Seems to lack dynamic light and needs an additional element of interest.', '2010-08-13 15:22:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6129214, 902884, 54446, '<td valign="top">Good concept, well executed.  Degree of difficulty is low, but I like the image.</td>', 'Good concept, well executed.  Degree of difficulty is low, but I like the image.', '2010-08-13 15:23:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6129215, 902510, 54446, '<td valign="top">Great exposure and composition.</td>', 'Great exposure and composition.', '2010-08-13 15:24:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6129217, 902479, 54446, '<td valign="top">Underexposed where it counts.  Just sort of murky image detail to suggest the identity of the subject.</td>', 'Underexposed where it counts.  Just sort of murky image detail to suggest the identity of the subject.', '2010-08-13 15:25:49.000000', NULL, 1),
