(6133464, 902877, 32011, '<td valign="top">This image has been awarded a MUAIMHO for this challenge thanks to the fact that it didn''t get the appreciation I felt it deserved, i.e. it was one of the Most Under Appreciated (IMHO).<br/> <br/>Most Under Appreciated IMHO (aka MUAIMHOs)<br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/32011/800/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_858386.png'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/32011/800/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_858386.png'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/32011/800/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_858386.png"/> <br/> <br/>I really like this.  It''s clever, it''s well composed... DOF might have been a little too narrow, but guess it had to be to blur the surface... just cause a bit of one of the bows to be a little OOF.  But even with this minor imperfection, it was still the highest rated (along with the other muaimho winner) photo in this challenge.  Well done.</td>', 'This image has been awarded a MUAIMHO for this challenge thanks to the fact that it didn''t get the appreciation I felt it deserved, i.e. it was one of the Most Under Appreciated (IMHO). Most Under Appreciated IMHO (aka MUAIMHOs)  I really like this.  It''s clever, it''s well composed... DOF might have been a little too narrow, but guess it had to be to blur the surface... just cause a bit of one of the bows to be a little OOF.  But even with this minor imperfection, it was still the highest rated (along with the other muaimho winner) photo in this challenge.  Well done.', '2010-08-18 01:37:39.000000', NULL, 0),
