(6133474, 902956, 32011, '<td valign="top">This image has been awarded a MUAIMHO for this challenge thanks to the fact that it didn''t get the appreciation I felt it deserved, i.e. it was one of the Most Under Appreciated (IMHO).<br/> <br/>Most Under Appreciated IMHO (aka MUAIMHOs)<br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/32011/800/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_858386.png'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/32011/800/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_858386.png'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/32011/800/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_858386.png"/> <br/> <br/>Beautifully composed capture.  Wonderful vision to see this, and I glad you shared it with us.  Never mind the masses (easy to say, hard to do... for me anyway... I''m forever trying to please them) and the score.  This is a great image and it is appreciated by me (and many other like me I''m sure).  This, along with the other muaimho recipient, was my highest rated image in the challenge, and most definitely deserved much more appreciation than it got.</td>', 'This image has been awarded a MUAIMHO for this challenge thanks to the fact that it didn''t get the appreciation I felt it deserved, i.e. it was one of the Most Under Appreciated (IMHO). Most Under Appreciated IMHO (aka MUAIMHOs)  Beautifully composed capture.  Wonderful vision to see this, and I glad you shared it with us.  Never mind the masses (easy to say, hard to do... for me anyway... I''m forever trying to please them) and the score.  This is a great image and it is appreciated by me (and many other like me I''m sure).  This, along with the other muaimho recipient, was my highest rated image in the challenge, and most definitely deserved much more appreciation than it got.', '2010-08-18 01:43:21.000000', NULL, 0),
